1
00:00:00,136 --> 00:00:02,306
(Penny:)to fix the pain you're
causing her right now?

2
00:00:04,073 --> 00:00:06,673
(Sheldon:)I'm sure you're right.

3
00:00:06,675 --> 00:00:09,615
(Sheldon:)I suppose I should
apologize to you, as well.

4
00:00:09,612 --> 00:00:11,242
(Penny:)Okay.

5
00:00:11,247 --> 00:00:14,217
(Sheldon:)That must have hurt watching me
look for other women

6
00:00:14,216 --> 00:00:17,116
(Sheldon:)without ever even
considering you.

7
00:00:21,423 --> 00:00:24,323
(Sheldon:)Please understand
that I think of you

8
00:00:24,326 --> 00:00:27,626
(Sheldon:)as more of a nanny.

9
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:31,830
(Penny:)Just finish your ice cream
so I can get you home to bed.

10
00:00:36,906 --> 00:00:39,036
(Raj:)I wonder if this is
what it feels like

11
00:00:39,041 --> 00:00:41,541
(Raj:)to be Bernadette's baby.

12
00:00:43,179 --> 00:00:46,209
(Stuart:)I don't know. Bernadette's baby
doesn't have a Jacuzzi jet

13
00:00:46,215 --> 00:00:48,485
(Stuart:)hitting just the right spot.

14
00:00:50,452 --> 00:00:54,652
(Howard:)Those jets are
for my secret spot, not his!

15
00:00:54,657 --> 00:00:56,957
What do you do in there?!

16
00:00:56,959 --> 00:01:03,019
(Howard:)It's called relaxing,
and that's all you need to know.

